  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ensuring Evidence-Based and Coordinated Durable Solutions Planning in Burundi Tool (Questionnaire, Training, Methodology)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to empower stakeholders in Burundi with capacities to collect, analyze and use data on stability in the context of human mobility in the view to drive evidence-based policy making for durable solutions, and ensure that interventions are informed by a thorough understanding of stability dynamics.</narrative>
  </description>
